  "title": "The Trout Trekker",
  "date": "2023-06-08",
  "excerpt": "El Capitan Build Tier",
  "body": [
    "In need of a van that's tailor-made for your angling adventures? This design hits the mark. Custom-built for a client who recently launched a fly fishing shop, this van perfectly accommodates multiple fly rods and accessories in the back.",
    "Take a moment to admire the exquisite interior, from the generous stainless steel fridge to the tastefully tiled backsplash and shower. This van is a true head-turner.",
    "But let's not forget about the rugged charm of the exterior. Feast your eyes on this El Capitan's highlights: a lift kit, striking black rhino wheels, Owl Vans accessories, 1Up bike trays, and a custom roof rack. And for those relaxing moments post-catch, there's an automatic awning to provide ample, comfortable shade.",
    "Powering the adventures is an upgraded 800W solar system, feeding into a substantial 500Ah of lithium batteries. Topped off with 40 gallons of fresh water, this van is primed for extended off-grid fishing escapades. Dive in and explore!"
  ],
